  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sydney WorldPride Human Rights Conference - Asia Pacific Scholarship support (2022-2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WorldPride was hosted in Sydney in 2023, with Sydney WorldPride having collaborated with Equality Australia and the Australian Federation of AIDS Organisations to convene the LGBTQIA+ Human Rights Conference as a centrepiece of the three-week festival. This investment contains DFAT support for the Speakers and Scholars Program, which enabled the attendance of 68 LGBTQIA+ human rights leaders and activists from the Asia-Pacific at the conference.</narrative>
  </description>
